# Comments

- Every source file starts with one short comment stating why the file exists (not a restatement of the path).
- Do not add other comments, dartdocs, or TODOs unless the logic is non-obvious.
- Non-obvious is rare: indent/lexer tricks, skip-list semantics, number verbatim vs resolved, protobean XOR, and similar.
- Leave generated Freezed (and similar) files alone.

```dart
# ❌ BAD
/// Parses an open directive.
ParsedDirective parseOpen(...) { ... }

# ✅ GOOD
// Petitparser productions for dated Beancount directives.
```
